  "description": [
    "127 pages : 24 cm",
    "More than just a simple snack, cupcakes can be dressed up to create a deliciously elegant dessert or can be magically transformed into a playful party animal. Whether you prefer fish or frogs, princesses or pandas, rocky road or raspberry streusel, Fun Stuff Cupcakes has the perfect cupcake for every occasion. Now you can indulge your passion for cupcakes with easy recipes that will make you the hit of every bake sale, backyard barbecue, or birthday bash. And you won t need to spend all day in the kitchen more than half of the recipes in Fun Stuff Cupcakes start with cake mix and prepared frosting so that they can be whipped up in minutes. Simple candies and decorations take them from ordinary to unforgettable. Each recipe in this handy hardcover cookbook includes simple directions, plus a full-page color photo of the finished product. If you re crazy for cupcakes, this is the book for you. Here are just some of the whimsical cupcake recipes you ll discover: Cookie in a Cupcake Sunny Side Upcakes Black Bottom Cupcakes Cupcake Ornaments Funny Bunnies",
    "Includes index",
    "Animal planet -- Celebration cupcakes -- Princess power -- Just plain fun -- Fruit follies -- Cha-cha-cha chocolate"
  ],
